Title:  They call me the Seeker

Seq:    12.6.162.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Townshend, Pete|Pete Townshend]], 1970, from the song "[[The Seeker]]"

Timestamp: 20261015180228

Date Added: 2026-10-15 12:02:28 -0600

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Referenced In: The fundamental human mystery

Body:

I'm looking for me; \
You're looking for you. \
We're looking at each other \
And we don't know what to do. \
  
They call me the seeker: \
I been searchin' low and high. \
I won't get to get what I'm after \
‘Till the day I die.
